        "full_name": "Nicolas Tata",
        "biography": "<p>Having spent NBL25 with the team as a training player, Nic Tata has been elevated into the lineup as United's Nominated Replacement Player for NBL26.</p>\n<p>Melbourne born and raised, Tata has showcased his elite athleticism at the NBL1 level, regularly skying high for alley-oop slams.</p>\n<p>Leading into the season, Tata put together his best performance with Nunawading, tallying 17 points and 17 rebounds in a dominant victory.</p>",
