        "full_name": "Tom Koppens",
        "biography": "<p>Set for his third season with Melbourne United as a Development Player, Tom Koppens is looking to build on his contributions across the past two campaigns.</p>\n<p>A versatile defender and tenacious competitor, Koppens was thrown into big moments last season, including some crucial possessions of the Grand Final series.</p>\n<p>The young forward took the confidence from those experiences into the offseason, leading the Sandringham Sabres to an NBL1 South Championship, where he was named Finals MVP.</p>",
