        "full_name": "Tanner Krebs",
        "biography": "<p>One of the league's most prolific shooters, Tanner Krebs has stretched the floor at an elite level across his first two seasons with Melbourne United while providing a level of intense defence at the other end of the court.</p>\n<p>The athletic wing is one of only two players that has appeared in all 73 of United's games across the past two seasons, showcasing his durability and toughness.</p>\n<p>This offseason, Krebs suited up for the Ringwood Hawks in the NBL1 South, where he averaged 20.1 points, 7.4 rebounds and 3.9 assists per game.</p>",
